{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆 こんちゃんわ (( (・ω・)/\nRottyだお ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2013/09/02/8862056/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は  京都で個別握手会を\nしてきました( 〃▽〃)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会場へ足を運んでくださった方\n本間にありがとう！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"天気悪かったから\n『皆大丈夫？来れるんかなあ？？』\n思っててん(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雨大丈夫でしたかん(´▽`)？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日も 皆に会えて本間に\n嬉ちかった 。\nわ〜い  わ〜い\\(о´∀`о)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日、握手会 初めましてやった方も\nこれからよろちくねんねん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっともっと 皆と色々\nおしゃべりしたぁ〜い(／▽＼)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スリッパ履いて握手会したら\n動き回れてめっちゃ楽しかった。\nいやん(*ノ▽ノ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"２期生ちゃん,〜*じゅんなちゃん*〜と"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2013/09/02/8862056/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝 京都へ向かう新幹線で\n寝ちゃってて起きたら\n足に凄いかたがついてたよ\\(・ω・)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それだけなの アハッ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2013/09/02/8862056/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぢゃあまた更新するねー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(^з^)-☆"}],"source":"archive"}